Package: wholeheard
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Wholeheard <Hello@c12c.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Breaks: summit (<< 0.2.0)
Replaces: summit (<< 0.2.0)
Recommends: gnome-shell-extension-appindicator, mesa-vulkan-drivers
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Description: Records a meeting, transcribes it and writes its minutes, on your machine
 Wholeheard records both sides of a call from the system tray, transcribes it on the machine with
 Whisper, and writes its minutes with the model you choose. Your meetings stay in your folder.
